: null, "body": "", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@tickring/works/18", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3643664, "client_id": 3407331, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3cf75d55/uploads/origins/f1cf2239-1ac4-4d86-a3b7-bdce447687bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4f933291a360a84453b997e9a42ee7be", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3cf75d55/uploads/origins/f1cf2239-1ac4-4d86-a3b7-bdce447687bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7d9cd46fe54a47e768c27124bd812bee", "src_set": ""}, "body": "HOWDYです！僕の名前はバイオ。趣味でVtuberやってます。\n\n私のVtuberアバターを描いてください。長い太い青い尻尾と白い蛇の虹彩を持つ蛇のカウボーイ。楽しくて幸せそうな彼を描いてください！その他はお任せします。楽しんでください！\n\nストリームやプロモーション用に使いたいと思います。リンクが必要ならTwitch.tv/biosteampunkで配信しています！\n\nhttps://bsky.app/profile/biosteampunk.bsky.social/post/3ltk2ms4qcs2q", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tickring/works/17", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3643664, "client_id": 904192, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9d146a4b/uploads/origins/ed25ee0e-0db1-4688-a692-0c1603a24d2a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b36fa943b2e2fe7eba3dd657a9286fc0", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9d146a4b/uploads/origins/ed25ee0e-0db1-4688-a692-0c1603a24d2a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=99b1af6cef36877c344500ef661ce588", "src_set": ""}, "body": "再びこんにちは！僕のOCの絵を描いてもらえないかな？彼は大きくて、タフで、意地悪に見えるけど、内面は優しいんだ。\n\nどんな風に描いてもいいよ！\n\nよろしくお願いします。\n\n参考文献：https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1897syqsthGBKaoTH33dXLYTcQPyzMNmY?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1897syqsthGBKaoTH33dXLYTcQPyzMNmY?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tickring/works/16", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3643664, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d35db96a/uploads/origins/cebf7032-1791-41f3-b9f5-47b9585779c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4fc20d5513136951d8d4be38658a82c8", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d35db96a/uploads/origins/cebf7032-1791-41f3-b9f5-47b9585779c3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=596623c30240b4e42f40992082549bfb", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！私のリクエストを考慮していただき、ありがとうございます。\n\nこのフェレットを描いていただけませんか？具体的には、タキシードを着ている絵を描いていただけますか？ポーズや表情はお任せします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Qfn424UNcZOrFKzJfSzqvNZLgU0LrJd4?usp=sharing", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tickring/works/15", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3643664, "client_id": 3477901, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3244cbfa/uploads/origins/16d8356c-0163-4738-9bd0-11e20deb53cb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=97f3efebad149e870fbe2b799d0e6e99", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3244cbfa/uploads/origins/16d8356c-0163-4738-9bd0-11e20deb53cb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5da5b68c88c8b447560a2458ccfa5c13", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは、\n\nVtuberのアシュトン・マーテンの絵をお願いしたいです。詳しくは彼女の頭だけ描いてください。例：https://drive.google.com/file/d/1sxSfVgz5h47bhmNZYD7P5NHj8lcNNSqY/view?usp=sharing\n\nちびっぽく描いていただけると嬉しいです！\n\n参考：https://drive.google.com/file/d/15twMFo_cJMhujmO1r_qrLnITe4KupXmH/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tickring/works/14", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3643664, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2bbdfa6a/uploads/origins/d51ab65b-7620-49b9-a10e-dbfa9f64151c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=de3ef0d4f746539503f780f1b41bbcfa", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2bbdfa6a/uploads/origins/d51ab65b-7620-49b9-a10e-dbfa9f64151c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d3f29c9974416a3c04904385ac322f6c", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！私のリクエストを考慮していただき、ありがとうございます。\n\nこの蛇を描いていただけませんか？自由に描いてください。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-G51Z60l8466xSPtMMMa_OJkUqESd3lz", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tickring/works/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3643664, "client_id": 3713546, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e10044d5/uploads/origins/58338942-1da0-4f1e-81e0-6307353f159c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70352418e89b110b280244e691a743cd", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e10044d5/uploads/origins/58338942-1da0-4f1e-81e0-6307353f159c?bg=%23fff&auto=for